ender useless or overload the Website or that may impede, in any manner whatsoever, its normal use and operation. To the extent that the Website or any activity contemplated by it would infringe any law of a jurisdiction, then You are prohibited from accessing or using the Website or attempting to carry on any such offending activity and this provision shall override all other provisions of these Terms. In this regard, You are informed that, should You breach the Terms and Conditions or any other particular terms or conditions contained in the Website, Havas People retains the right to limit, suspend or terminate his access to the Website, adopting any technical measure necessary for such purpose. In addition, Havas People retains the right to put in place such measures should it have any reasonable suspicion that the User is violating any of the terms and conditions of the aforementioned instruments. Should any of the provisions of the Terms and Conditions be declared null, it shall be removed or replaced. In any case, such declaration of nullity shall not affect the rest of the provisions of the Terms and Conditions. Contact us If You have any concerns or queries about material which appears on our Website or if You have questions about Your use of this Website or these Terms and Conditions please email us at client-services@engageats.co.uk If You have any suggestions for improvements or additions that You would like to see on the Website please email us client-services@engageats.co.uk . Our postal address for correspondence is [Havas People, The HKX Building, 3 Pancras Square, London, N1C 4AG]. 1.0.0.20 Login Register Email Address: Please enter a valid email address. Password: Sign in Forgot password? Your password has expired, please create a new password below. Your email address has not been verified. Please check your email or click here to resend. Verification email has been resent. Email Address: Please enter a valid email address. Reset password Cancel Em